---
description: Israeli full male name — one given name and one surname (יונתן כהן). Hebrew names carry a single surname, unlike the two-surname Spanish form, and the surname is drawn from the common list because Israeli surnames do not inflect for gender.
generator: tdc
locale: he
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="he.person.male.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="he.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
